Source: swizzle
Section: utils
Maintainer: Barak A. Pearlmutter <bap@debian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Homepage: https://github.com/barak/swizzle

Package: swizzle
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: intercept and redirect file access in wrapped programs
 Runs programs with LD_PRELOAD-based path rewriting so selected source
 path prefixes are redirected to destination prefixes. Also installs
 claude-lconf, a helper that maps project-local .../.claude paths to
 ~/.config/claude/... before launching claude.
